<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2000] Run paragraph on enter when z.select form value changed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2000</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;PR#1647 disabled instant on select value change.&lt;br/&gt;
In report view mode, the only way to apply changed value is running whole note.&lt;br/&gt;
There should be a way to run with new selected value in report mode and I suggest to enable run by hitting &apos;enter&apos; key after selection.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
